    "text": "Edward Noel Pick (born October 31, 1968) is an American banker who is the chief executive officer of Morgan Stanley since January 2024 and the company's chairman since January 2025. He previously was the bank's Co-President, Co-Head of Firm Strategy and Head of the Institutional Securities Group, overseeing Investment Banking, Equities, Fixed Income, Global Capital Markets and Research.",
